# Stacked List — 50 blue cards in a FlatList whose positions come entirely from
# one animated style per item: cards near the bottom edge pile into a scaled,
# faded stack and unstack as you scroll (extended interpolation of opacity).
# What this test covers: slow drags (cards leaving the stack one by one), a
# held drag stopped mid-card, flings all the way to the end of the 50 cards
# and overscroll there (extended opacity extrapolation, hidden/fully-visible
# shortcut styles), slow drags back up, a fling stopped by a touch, and
# another run to the end. Upward travel stays short of the top (pull-down at
# the top is the app's close gesture).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/stacked-list"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 700 0 -110 900
wait 500
gesture pan 200 700 0 -110 900
wait 500
gesture pan 200 700 0 -55 1200
wait 800
gesture pan 200 700 0 -300 700
wait 600
# Fling to the end (5.5k pt of content).
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 1500
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 1500
# Slow drags back up through the stack.
gesture pan 200 300 0 220 900
wait 500
gesture pan 200 300 0 220 900
wait 500
# Fling back up and stop it with a touch.
swipe 200 250 200 750
wait 200
press 200 450
wait 800
# And down to the end again.
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 200
swipe 200 800 200 150
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
